    "body": "The spec seems pretty clear it should not. This follows from how the spec does not prescribe any particular date picker UI, so saying that one should pop up leads to unpredictable experiences, as you've found.\r\n\r\nIt sounds like you've found some good browser bugs though! Do you need help filing them?",
