    "body": "I believe input type=file also behave this way but selects don't. So there isn't a clear answer here. Since there isn't much interoperability here in any browser we should try to evaluate what sites are doing it and why. When we removed it for selects and we had a few minor reports but it was fine. However we had to leave it in for webviews because a few webview apps were broken.",
