    "created_at": "2025-01-23T07:51:51Z",
    "updated_at": "2025-01-23T07:51:51Z",
    "body": "Chrome on Android still shows a date picker with `click()`, which caused a compat bug for Firefox: https://bugzilla.mozilla.org/show_bug.cgi?id=1930113\n\nCan this be changed in Chrome on Android?\n\nThe spec has defined input activation behavior for `color` and `file`, so it's currently inconsistent.",
